# patch-package writes patches whose filenames contain '@' (scoped packages),
# e.g. @hubspot+cms-dev-server+1.2.25.patch, and `hs project upload` rejects '@'
# in filenames. These patches only matter for the LOCAL dev server
# (@hubspot/cms-dev-server is a devDependency, not installed in the remote
# build), so keep them on disk for `npm start` but exclude them from upload.
cms-assets/patches
patches
